message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Sediment Reference Dataset Basin Pipeline"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sediment Reference Dataset contributors"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jellywzx/sed_data_integration"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - sediment
  - river basin
  - hydrology
  - reference dataset
  - ESSD
abstract: >-
  Python workflow for building a basin-based sediment reference dataset from
  multi-source river sediment observations, including temporal resolution
  classification, upstream basin tracing, station clustering, NetCDF export,
  geospatial sidecars, and publication audit checks.
